          "type": "mVersion ( \" Unknown"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Structure used by plug-ins for identification purposes.\n\\note To avoid confusions in the system, it is recommended to choose an appropriate unique identifier string name when\ndefining your plug-in, as well as incrementing the version string to a correct value whenever something changes in the\nimplementation of the plug-in. Both of these string are used when comparing plug-ins for searches, as well as\nidentification in FBX files."
    },
